/*put "Componentes: ". 

if can-find (first it-comp-exame where it-comp-exame.it-codigo = exam-ficha.it-codigo and it-comp-exame.cod-exame = exam-ficha.cod-exame) then do:
    for each it-comp-exame no-lock where 
